    "description": "Triggers such as OnValidateUpgradePerCompany run on every upgrade pass. A full-table scan or cross-table validation therefore adds cost to every upgrade of every tenant. Validation is a read-only lifecycle check, so it cannot make itself one-time by writing an upgrade tag.",
